B442WP is a pay-per-conversion SaaS that converts Base44 React apps into
production-ready WordPress themes. Users upload a Base44 ZIP export, get a
free preview/analysis, pay once ($9 basic, $19 WooCommerce), and download
a ready-to-upload WordPress theme ZIP.

Live app: https://app.base44towordpress.com
Marketing: https://base44towordpress.com (separate WordPress site, not in this repo)

Stack: PHP 8.0+, SQLite (PDO/WAL), zero framework, raw cURL for HTTP.
Payments: Stripe Checkout (mode:"payment") + PayPal Orders v2.
AI: Claude API (claude-sonnet-4-20250514) via messages endpoint.

