## PRICING AND PAYMENT FLOW
==============================================================================

Prices (in config.php, in cents):
  price_basic:       900  = $9.00   (no WooCommerce)
  price_woocommerce: 1900 = $19.00  (with WooCommerce)

Stripe flow:
  1. User clicks "Pay with Stripe" on preview.php
  2. pay.php calls create_stripe_checkout() → Stripe API creates session
  3. Redirect to Stripe hosted checkout
  4. On success → /convert/{uuid}?stripe_session_id={id}
  5. convert.php calls verify_stripe_session() → confirms payment_status=paid
  6. Marks conversion 'paid', runs conversion, shows progress

PayPal flow:
  1. User clicks "Pay with PayPal" on preview.php
  2. pay.php calls create_paypal_order() → PayPal Orders v2 API
  3. Redirect to PayPal approval URL
  4. On return → /convert/{uuid}?paypal_order_id={id}&paypal_token={t}
  5. convert.php calls capture_paypal_order() → confirms COMPLETED status
  6. Same as steps 5-6 above

Webhooks are BACKUP only. Primary verification is in convert.php on redirect.
CRITICAL: Stripe mode MUST be "payment" (never "subscription").
CRITICAL: PayPal intent MUST be "CAPTURE" (never "AUTHORIZE").

