## SECURITY PATTERNS
==============================================================================

- CSRF: double-submit token stored in session, verified with hash_equals()
- Auth: session_regenerate_id(true) on login, httponly/samesite=Lax cookies
- Passwords: password_hash(BCRYPT, cost=12), password_verify()
- SQL: PDO prepared statements only, no string interpolation in queries
- File paths: realpath() + prefix check before serving downloads
- Rate limiting: middleware.php rate_limit() using APCu or file-based counter
- Input: sanitize_text_field() equivalent (strip_tags + trim) via sanitize()
- Output: htmlspecialchars() via e() helper for all user-generated content
- Upload: validates .zip extension, max 50MB, temp storage cleaned after parse
- Webhook Stripe: verify_stripe_webhook() using hash_hmac HMAC-SHA256
- Webhook PayPal: verifies via PayPal API callback validation

